{"id":"vod_sn_38470","vodId":"38470","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"花样滑冰Stars","name_cn":"花样滑冰Stars","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0c9b8cbad9fb8dc4293616fe981460b8.jpg"},"summary":"「你一辈子都赢不了我。」竞争对手・篠崎怜凤的这句话，让前岛绚晴放弃了花滑。数年后，成为高中生的前岛凭著其卓越的运动神经，充当著各个社团的外援，然而自己却从不热衷于任何事，就这样虚度光阴。某一天，前岛看到曾经的对手篠崎召开记者会，宣称将从个人项目转战至Skate-Leading。随后一名自称叫流石井隼人的少年出现在了前岛面前。他似乎知晓前岛过去在个人花滑项目中的活跃表现，并对前岛说「我需要你」，邀请他进入花滑团体竞技项目·Skate-Leading的世界。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yT47XiXASX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hcLZrc7WcL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BVYAG0TDup1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KQr0FVQG0P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qx6tP1Rcvm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/njfrvHSgze1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JBUPvvusYj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6fGMkkqZKV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x6F2JFgXEz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0aU7fC8L971/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XpFUG5UkVs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GDu2WkqMNH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.527Z"}